sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as 业务线程
    participant Disk as DiskLogAdapter
    participant HT as DOFLog_write
    participant FS as 文件系统

    UI->>Disk: log(type, model, tag, msg)
    Disk->>Disk: AndroidLogFormat.format
    Disk->>HT: sendMessage(MsgEntry)
    Note over UI: 立刻返回
    HT->>FS: FileIOUtils.append 写 txt
